shadhin-browser (0.1.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Ubuntu 24.04 (noble).
  * WebKitGTK 6.0 engine integration with bubblewrap sandboxing.
  * Native GTK4 and Libadwaita glassmorphism interface.
  * Privacy shield, tracker blocking, and isolated workspaces.

